WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,940 --> 00:00:02,340
Is it blooming?

2
00:00:02,340 --> 00:00:04,670
The tongue vine itself will not bear fruit.

3
00:00:04,670 --> 00:00:06,070
Because of plainclothes

4
00:00:06,070 --> 00:00:07,870
So it blossoms and bears fruit

5
00:00:07,870 --> 00:00:10,760
I don’t know the fruits produced by the silver bell tongue vine

6
00:00:10,760 --> 00:00:26,800
Is it an ordinary spiritual fruit or a spiritual beast? Let’s go, young master.

7
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:28,000
The location of the grotto

8
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:30,720
Is it right opposite our medicinal field?

9
00:00:30,720 --> 00:00:32,720
The distance and direction are just right

10
00:00:32,720 --> 00:00:34,300
Really

11
00:00:34,300 --> 00:00:35,900
No wonder the magical herbs in our medicinal field

12
00:00:35,900 --> 00:00:37,300
Always half-dead

13
00:00:37,300 --> 00:00:39,300
No matter how much fertilizer is wet, it won't work

14
00:00:39,300 --> 00:00:40,700
It turns out that all the nutrients are underground

15
00:00:40,700 --> 00:00:42,300
These spiritual qualities were sucked away

16
00:00:43,300 --> 00:00:46,450
It’s really a white cancer that has been scolded so much.

17
00:00:46,450 --> 00:00:48,450
You have indeed been greatly wronged
